{
  "job_B23.3.2.1_20251003_114604": {
    "text": "Luna I qui inciderit, difficile euadet Se \u00fee afeal\u00f0, earfo\u00f0lice he \u00e6twint.\nLuna II, cito consurget ra\u00f0e he aris\u00fe.\nLuna III, non eundet he ne \u00e6twint.\nLuna IIII, laboret et surget he swinc\u00f0 and aris\u00f0.\nLuna V, tricabit et surget he sipa\u00f0 and aris\u00f0.\nLuna VI, non euadet he ne \u00e6twint.\nLuna VII, medicina sanabitur mid l\u00e6cedome he bi\u00f0 geh\u00e6led.\nLuna VIII, diu languet et surget lange he adla\u00f0 and aris\u00f0.\nLuna IX, languet he adla\u00f0.\nLuna X diu egrotat lange he sicla\u00f0.\nLuna XI, periculo periclitat on frecednesse he dyrf\u00f0.\nLuna XII, surget he aris\u00fe.\nLuna XIII, alignot tempus egrotat sumne timan he siccla\u00f0.\nLuna XIIII, laborat et surget he swinc\u00f0 and aris\u00fe.\nLuna XV periclitat he dyrf\u00f0.\nLuna XVI, locum mitabit et surget stowe he awent and aris\u00f0.\nLuna XVII, tricabit et surget he sipa\u00f0 and aris\u00fe.\nLuna XVIII, laborabit et surget he swinc\u00f0 and aris\u00f0.\nLuna XIX, similiter eallswa.\nLuna XX, similiter eallswa.\nLuna XXI, rem adiuuabit \u00f0ingc he fultuma\u00f0.\nLuna XXII, languet et surget he adla\u00f0 and aris\u00fe.\nLuna XXIII, similiter eallswa.\nLuna XXIIII, diu languet lange he adla\u00f0.\nLuna XXV, languet et morietur adla\u00f0 and he swelt.\nLuna XXVI, languet he adla\u00f0.\nLuna XXVII, tricabit et surget he sipa\u00f0 and aris\u00fe.\nLuna XXVIII, eger multum iacebit et morietur seoc swi\u00f0e he li\u00f0 and swylt.\nLuna XXIX, eger euadet seoc \u00e6twint.\nLuna XXX, eger laborabit et surget seoc he swinc\u00f0 and aris\u00f0.",
